{"id":"nce1-083","book":"nce1","numbers":[83,84],"label":"Lesson 83–84","titleEn":"Going on Holiday","titleCn":"度假","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/083.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.18,"en":"Going on holiday","cn":"去度假了"},{"t":6.52,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":12.15,"en":"Where did Sam go for his holiday this year?","cn":"今年山姆去哪里度假了？"},{"t":19.0,"en":"Hello, Sam.","cn":"你好，萨姆。"},{"t":20.59,"en":"Come in.","cn":"请进来。"},{"t":23.06,"en":"Hi, Sam.","cn":"嗨，萨姆。"},{"t":24.71,"en":"We're having lunch.","cn":"我们正在吃午饭。"},{"t":26.88,"en":"Do you want to have lunch with us?","cn":"你想和我们一起吃午饭吗？"},{"t":30.98,"en":"No, thank you, Tom.","cn":"不，谢谢你，汤姆。"},{"t":33.18,"en":"I've already had lunch.","cn":"我已经吃过午饭了。"},{"t":35.97,"en":"I had lunch at half past twelve.","cn":"我十二点半吃了午饭。"},{"t":39.98,"en":"Have a cup of coffee then.","cn":"那就喝杯咖啡吧。"},{"t":42.93,"en":"I've just had a cup, thank you.","cn":"我刚刚喝了一杯，谢谢。"},{"t":46.25,"en":"I had one after my lunch.","cn":"我午饭后吃了一个。"},{"t":49.96,"en":"Let's go into the living room, Carol.","cn":"我们一起去客厅吧，卡罗尔。"},{"t":53.75,"en":"We can have our coffee there.","cn":"我们可以在那里喝咖啡。"},{"t":57.12,"en":"Excuse the mess, Sam.","cn":"“对不起，弄得这么乱，萨姆。”"},{"t":60.33,"en":"This room's very untidy.","cn":"这个房间非常乱。"},{"t":63.51,"en":"We're packing our suitcases.","cn":"我们正在打包行李箱。"},{"t":66.42,"en":"We're going to leave tomorrow.","cn":"我们明天就要出发了。"},{"t":69.85,"en":"Tom and I are going to have a holiday.","cn":"我和汤姆打算去度个假。"},{"t":74.33,"en":"Aren't you lucky!","cn":"你真幸运啊！"},{"t":77.49,"en":"When are you going to have a holiday, Sam?","cn":"山姆，你什么时候能放假呢？"},{"t":81.58,"en":"I don't know.","cn":"我不知道。"},{"t":83.46,"en":"I've already had my holiday this year.","cn":"我今年已经度过了假期。"},{"t":88.1,"en":"Where did you go?","cn":"你去哪里度假了？"},{"t":90.22,"en":"I stayed at home!","cn":"我待在家里！"}],"words":[{"word":"mess","phonetic":["mes"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"杂乱，凌乱","us":"media/words/nce1/w0604_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0604_e.mp3"}